
//CONJURE ELEMENTAL//
COPY "rick_bigg_mod/spell/SPWI699.spl" "override"
	SAY NAME1 "Conjure Elemental"
	SAY UNIDENTIFIED_DESC 
"Conjure Elemental
Level: 6
School: Conjuration
Range: Medium
Duration: 3 turns
Casting Time: 6
Area of Effect: Special
Saving Throw: None

Upon casting Conjure Elemental, the caster chooses an element and opens a special gate to the relative Plane, and an elemental is summoned to the vicinity of the spellcaster. There is a 20% chance that a more powerful elemental will be summoned. The elemental serves the caster's every whim until banished back to its home plane, the spell duration expires, or upon the elemental's death.


Air Elemental (12 Hit Dice):
STR 16, DEX 19, CON 17, INT 6, WIS 11, CHA 11;  AL Neutral
HP 116, AC 0, THAC0 5, Saving Throws 7/9/8/8/10
3 Attacks Per Round, 1d8+4 Piercing Damage (Fist +3)

Greater Air Elemental (16 Hit Dice):
STR 18, DEX 21, CON 18, INT 6, WIS 11, CHA 11;  AL Neutral
HP 138, AC -1, THAC0 1, Saving Throws 4/6/5/4/7
3 Attacks Per Round, 1d10+5 Piercing Damage (Fist +3)

Special Qualities (Air, 12 & 16 Hit Dice):
Immune to normal weapons
Immune to hold, poison, polymorph, sleep, & stun effects
Slashing, Crushing, & Piercing Resistance 20%; Missile Resistance 60%


Earth Elemental (12 Hit Dice):
STR 20, DEX 8, CON 19, INT 6, WIS 11, CHA 11;  AL Neutral
HP 126, AC 3, THAC0 5, Saving Throws 7/9/8/8/10
2 Attacks Per Round, 2d8+11 Crushing Damage (Fist +3)

Greater Earth Elemental (16 Hit Dice):
STR 21, DEX 8, CON 20, INT 6, WIS 11, CHA 11;  AL Neutral
HP 136, AC 2, THAC0 1, Saving Throws 4/6/5/4/7
2 Attacks Per Round, 2d10+12 Crushing Damage (Fist +3)

Special Qualities (Earth, 12 & 16 Hit Dice):
Immune to normal weapons
Immune to hold, poison, polymorph, sleep, & stun effects
Slashing, Piercing, & Missile Resistance 40%


Fire Elemental (12 Hit Dice):
STR 16, DEX 17, CON 17, INT 6, WIS 11, CHA 11;  AL Neutral
HP 116, AC 1, THAC0 7, Saving Throws 7/9/8/8/10
2 Attacks Per Round, 2d6+4 Slashing +2d6 Fire Damage (Fist +3)

Greater Fire Elemental (16 Hit Dice):
STR 18, DEX 19, CON 18, INT 6, WIS 11, CHA 11;  AL Neutral
HP 138, AC 0, THAC0 3, Saving Throws 4/6/5/4/7
2 Attacks Per Round, 2d8+5 Slashing +2d8 Fire Damage (Fist +3)

Special Qualities (Fire, 12 & 16 Hit Dice):
Immune to normal weapons
Immune to hold, poison, polymorph, sleep, & stun effects
Fire Resistance 100%
Slashing, Crushing, Piercing, & Missile Resistance 20%


Water Elemental (12 Hit Dice):
STR 12, DEX 19, CON 18, INT 6, WIS 11, CHA 11;  AL Neutral
HP 90, AC 1, THAC0 7, Saving Throws 7/9/8/8/10
2 Attacks Per Round, 2d6+3 Missile +1d8 Magic Damage (Wave +3)

Water Elemental (16 Hit Dice):
STR 14, DEX 21, CON 18, INT 6, WIS 11, CHA 11;  AL Neutral
HP 110, AC 0, THAC0 3, Saving Throws 4/6/5/4/7
2 Attacks Per Round, 2d8+3 Missile +1d10 Magic Damage (Wave +3)

Special Qualities (Water, 12 & 16 Hit Dice):
Immune to normal weapons
Immune to hold, poison, polymorph, sleep, & stun effects
Magic Damage Resistance 100%
Slashing, Crushing, & Piercing Resistance 20%; Missile Resistance 60%
"







